/* MQTT EXEC -- MQTT in the Debian guest, from CMS (9.25)              */
/*   MQTT PUB topic message      publish a message                     */
/*   MQTT PUB topic (FILE fn ft  publish each line of a file           */
/*   MQTT SUB topic [n [secs]]   wait for n messages (1), secs (10)    */
/* over LXCALL: the options of LXCALL (SERVER userid ...) work here.   */
PARSE ARG LINE
'EXEC LXCALL MQTT' LINE
EXIT RC
